{"ocrText": "103\nPROSECUTE  RODZYANKO  AND  JUNKOVSKY\nFOR  CONCEALING  AN  AGENT  PROVOCATEUR!\nThe findings of the committee of inquiry into the case of\nthe agent provocateur Malinovsky indicate that the fol-\nlowing  fact  has  been  established:\nBoth Junkovsky and Rodzyanko knew, not later than May\n7,  1914,  that  Malinovsky  was  an  agent  provocateur.49\nNeither of the two leaders warned the political parties in\nthe Duma, primarily the Bolsheviks, of the agent provocateur\noperating  in  their  midst!!\nIsn\u2019t  that  a  crime?\nHow can Junkovsky and Rodzyanko be tolerated after\nthat  among  honest  citizens?\nLet all political parties think it over, and let them voice\ntheir  opinion!\nPravda  No.  84,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  30  (17),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "103", "x": 85.57, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.32, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "PROSECUTE", "x": 16.59, "y": 25.97, "w": 17.61, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "RODZYANKO", "x": 35.61, "y": 25.97, "w": 18.44, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "AND", "x": 55.53, "y": 25.97, "w": 6.2, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "JUNKOVSKY", "x": 63.17, "y": 25.97, "w": 18.06, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "FOR", "x": 14.76, "y": 28.17, "w": 5.86, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "CONCEALING", "x": 22.1, "y": 28.17, "w": 19.45, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "AN", "x": 42.99, "y": 28.17, "w": 4.1, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "AGENT", "x": 48.56, "y": 28.17, "w": 10.04, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "PROVOCATEUR!", "x": 60.06, "y": 28.17, "w": 22.99, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "The findings of the committee of inquiry into the case of", "x": 11.67, "y": 32.76, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the agent provocateur Malinovsky indicate that the fol-", "x": 8.89, "y": 34.7, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "lowing  fact  has  been  established:", "x": 8.89, "y": 36.62, "w": 45.98, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Both Junkovsky and", "x": 11.67, "y": 38.56, "w": 27.6, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Rodzyanko knew", "x": 39.73, "y": 38.58, "w": 22.04, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ", not later than May", "x": 61.84, "y": 38.56, "w": 27.04, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "7,  1914,  that  Malinovsky  was  an  agent  provocateur.", "x": 8.89, "y": 40.5, "w": 71.9, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "49", "x": 80.92, "y": 40.4, "w": 1.9, "h": 1.16, "fontSize": 6.9}, {"text": "Neither", "x": 11.67, "y": 42.45, "w": 10.57, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of the two leaders", "x": 22.7, "y": 42.44, "w": 24.93, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "warned", "x": 48.09, "y": 42.45, "w": 10.5, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the political parties in", "x": 59.05, "y": 42.44, "w": 29.85, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the Duma, primarily the Bolsheviks, of the agent provocateur", "x": 8.89, "y": 44.38, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "operating  in  their  midst!!", "x": 8.89, "y": 46.32, "w": 34.71, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Isn\u2019t  that  a  crime?", "x": 11.67, "y": 48.23, "w": 26.36, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "How can Junkovsky and", "x": 11.67, "y": 50.17, "w": 35.13, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Rodzyanko", "x": 47.67, "y": 50.19, "w": 15.5, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "be tolerated after", "x": 64.09, "y": 50.17, "w": 24.8, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "that  among  honest  citizens?", "x": 8.89, "y": 52.11, "w": 37.52, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Let all political parties think it over, and let them voice", "x": 11.67, "y": 54.05, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "their  opinion!", "x": 8.89, "y": 55.99, "w": 18.67, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 10.22, "y": 59.88, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 18.28, "y": 59.